sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Parent as Parent<br/>(BDT account)
  participant A as Bank A<br/>(Bangladesh bank)
  participant C as Correspondent<br/>bank
  participant U as University's<br/>bank
  participant Uni as University<br/>(GBP account)

  Parent->>A: Confirm the transfer with MFA
  Note over A: Reserve BDT 1,634,500.00<br/>(customer account to "in flight")
  Note over A: Hop 1: sell GBP 10,000 at 163.20,<br/>keep BDT 2,500 fees,<br/>pay out of its nostro at C
  A->>C: MT103 (UETR, charge code OUR)
  Note over C: Hop 2: debit Bank A's vostro,<br/>keep any lifting fee,<br/>pay through its nostro at U
  C->>U: MT103
  Note over U: Hop 3: credit the customer,<br/>keep any receiving fee
  U->>Uni: GBP 10,000.00 credited
  Note over Parent,Uni: Every hop is one balanced journal and one audit event.<br/>If any hop fails, every journal is reversed, newest first.
